  "details": "I'd like to see two additional toggle options in the settings: one to enable auto-run, and another to assign a key for switching to run mode.\n\nAlthough I frequently play VRChat in VR mode, occasionally when using a PC keyboard, running requires holding down both W and Shift for extended periods, which makes my fingers feel extremely fatigued. Whether using VR controllers or a game controller, running only requires pushing the joystick. It's hard to understand why the PC keyboard requires such redundant operations, and there isn't even a toggle to switch to running mode.",
